    "sentence_translations": [
      "Where Do I Get Off?",
      "",
      "If you ask for directions in Beijing, don’t ask a Beijing resident.",
      "Because people who live in Beijing like to say north, south, east, and west. They don’t like to say left and right.",
      "Do you know which way north is?",
      "",
      "If you’re going to take a bus, you also have to be careful.",
      "Because the bus stop names are a bit difficult. There is a stop named Beijing West Railway Station, South Square.",
      "Do you know which train station you’re at?",
      "",
      "If you want to go and and take a look at Qianmen Road, don’t take the bus. Because the driver will say, ..",
      ".. “We have arrived at Qianmen. Please use the door at the back to get off .”",
      "Do you know where you should get off the bus?",
      ""
